flowchart LR
  U[User] -->|credentials| LOGIN[Login form]
  LOGIN --> AUTH[AuthContext]
  AUTH -->|token in memory| API[services/api.js]
  U -->|services, region confirmation, context| AUDIT[CloudAudit local state]
  AUDIT -->|generated read-only audit prompt| MUT[useChatMutation]
  MUT --> API
  API -->|bearer HTTP requests| BE[FastAPI]
  BE -->|structured audit, review text, citations, assessment id| API
  API --> MUT
  MUT -->|result| WORK[AgentWorkflow and MarkdownView]
  MUT -->|invalidate| CACHE[TanStack Query cache]
  CACHE --> DASH[Dashboard, Findings, ReportDetail]
  BE -->|persisted assessments| CACHE
  API -->|401 event| SESSION[SessionEvents]
  SESSION -->|sign out and redirect| AUTH
  API -->|ApiError| ERR[ErrorState, retry or form error]
  U --> SETTINGS[Settings]
  SETTINGS -->|backend origin only| LS[(localStorage)]
  LS --> API
